}, {
  "@id" : "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/source",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology" ],
  "http://creativecommons.org/ns#license" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor" : [ {
    "@value" : "María Luz Couce Pico (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4861-9905)"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator" : [ {
    "@value" : "David Prieto González (https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1411-129X)"
  }, {
    "@value" : "Evelio J. González González (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2203-3757)"
  }, {
    "@value" : "Iván Castilla Rodríguez (http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3933-2582)"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Ontology designed for collecting and inferring the parameters required to create a simulation-based Health Technology Assesment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Ontología diseñada para recopilar e inferir los parámetros necesarios para crear una evaluación de tecnología sanitaria basada en simulación"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://github.com/ontologies-ULL/OSDi"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This ontology provides a structured framework for the interoperability of health economics data used to create models. The ontology represents all the concepts and relationships involved in health technology assessment, including the characterization of the disease and its development, the population affected, and the interventions applied."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Las restricciones only sin cardinalidad son orientativas y señalan qué propiedades aplican a cada clase"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The only restrictions without cardinality are indicative and indicate which properties apply to each class"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "OSDi"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "OSDi"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#priorVersion" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi/1.2"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi/1.3"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo" : [ {
    "@value" : "1.3"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AcuteManifestation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Aparición súbita o rápida de signos o síntomas clínicos, en general con un curso corto e intenso. Sus costes y utilidades se aplican por episodio, así que deberían ser de una vez (appliesOneTime = true); una utilidad de una vez es una pérdida de AVAC. En un árbol de decisión, una manifestación aguda representa un único episodio entre la edad inicial de la población y la muerte: su caracterización del riesgo es la probabilidad de que ocurra el episodio y, como cualquier otra progresión, una manifestación aguda sin riesgo ocurre siempre en su contexto. Un árbol de decisión ignora la frecuencia (hasFrequency) de una manifestación aguda que define un riesgo, y no puede representar una que solo define una frecuencia. Los costes y utilidades anuales de una manifestación aguda se ignoran tanto en los árboles de decisión como en las simulaciones de eventos discretos."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sudden or rapid appearance of clinical signs or symptoms, in general with a short and intense course. Its costs and utilities apply per episode, so they should be one-time (appliesOneTime = true); a one-time utility is a loss of QALYs. In a decision tree, an acute manifestation represents a single episode between the initial age of the population and death: its risk characterization is the probability that the episode happens, and, as for any other progression, an acute manifestation without risk always happens in its context. A decision tree ignores the frequency (hasFrequency) of an acute manifestation that defines a risk, and cannot represent one that only defines a frequency. Annual costs and utilities of an acute manifestation are ignored both in decision trees and in discrete-event simulations."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Acute manifestation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Manifestación aguda"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Manifestation"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid202"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionWithInitialProportion"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AdverseEvent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A health condition caused by a strategy (hasAdverseEvent), e.g., the diarrhoea caused by an antibiotic. Each time a strategy is applied, each of its adverse events happens with its risk (hasRiskCharacterization: a probability per application, or a time to event in a simulation), independently of the outcome of the strategy, unless the strategy fails because of the adverse event (failsIf), e.g., when the treatment is abandoned. Its costs and utilities apply once, when it happens (annual ones are not meaningful); its effects (including an InstantDeathEffect) and its own strategies apply to the patients who suffer it. isOccurrenceOf identifies the health condition it represents, but does not activate the structure of that condition. Rule for the modeller: if the problem belongs to the natural history of the disease and the strategy only changes its risk, use an Effect of the strategy on that risk; if the problem is caused by the strategy, use an AdverseEvent."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Una condición de salud provocada por una estrategia (hasAdverseEvent), p. ej., la diarrea causada por un antibiótico. Cada vez que se aplica una estrategia, cada uno de sus efectos adversos ocurre con su riesgo (hasRiskCharacterization: una probabilidad por aplicación o, en simulación, un tiempo hasta el evento), con independencia del resultado de la estrategia, salvo que esta fracase por el efecto adverso (failsIf), p. ej., cuando se abandona el tratamiento. Sus costes y utilidades se aplican una vez, cuando ocurre (los anuales no tienen sentido); sus efectos (incluido un InstantDeathEffect) y sus propias estrategias se aplican a los pacientes que lo sufren. isOccurrenceOf identifica la condición de salud que representa, pero no activa la estructura de esa condición. Regla para quien modela: si el problema forma parte de la evolución natural de la enfermedad y la estrategia solo cambia su riesgo, se usa un Effect de la estrategia sobre ese riesgo; si lo provoca la estrategia, un AdverseEvent."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Adverse event"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Efecto adverso"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#HealthCondition"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid203"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid204"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Disease"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AgentBasedModel",
