}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DiseaseProgressionElement",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An element characterizing the progression of a disease"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Un elemento que caracteriza la progresión de una enfermedad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Disease progression element"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Elemento de progresión de la enfermedad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DrugCat",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#TreatmentCat"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tratamiento basado en la administración de medicamentos o fármacos."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Treatment based on the administration of medicinal products or drugs."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ResourceUsageCategoryScheme"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Drug-based treatment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tratamiento farmacológico"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Effect",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An effect of a treatment or intervention. It applies its magnitude (hasEffectMagnitude) to the parameters or attributes it affects (affects). The subclasses define how the magnitude is applied (an instant death effect sets a probability of death, a life expectancy reduction effect subtracts years of life and an increased mortality rate effect multiplies the mortality rate), and a strategy replacement effect replaces the strategies of a health condition (see StrategyReplacementEffect); for a generic effect, the data item type of the magnitude defines the operation (see hasEffectMagnitude). When several effects modify the same parameter, the order is decided by the application; the suggested order is: first replace, then multiply (linear factors, then ratios of rates, then odds ratios) and finally subtract. At most one effect should replace the same parameter."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Un efecto de un tratamiento o intervención. Aplica su magnitud (hasEffectMagnitude) a los parámetros o atributos a los que afecta (affects). Las subclases definen cómo se aplica la magnitud (un efecto de muerte inmediata fija una probabilidad de muerte, un efecto de reducción de la esperanza de vida resta años de vida y un efecto de aumento de la tasa de mortalidad multiplica la tasa de mortalidad), y un efecto de sustitución de estrategias sustituye las estrategias de una condición de salud (ver StrategyReplacementEffect); en un efecto genérico, el tipo de dato de la magnitud define la operación (ver hasEffectMagnitude). Cuando varios efectos modifican el mismo parámetro, el orden lo decide la aplicación; el orden sugerido es: primero sustituir, después multiplicar (factores lineales, después razones de tasas y después odds ratios) y por último restar. Como mucho un efecto debería sustituir un mismo parámetro."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Efecto"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Effect"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid330"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid335"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid336"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid337"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#EpidemiologicalParameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A parameter related to the epidemiology (prevalence, incidence...) of a disease or condition"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Un parámetro relacionado con la epidemiología (prevalencia, incidencia...) de una enfermedad o condición"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Epidemiological parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Parámetro epidemiológico"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid338"
  } ]
