    "@id" : "_:genid513"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Parameters used for computing outcomes or characterize certain class. They have a source, a geographical context, year, description and value"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Parámetros usados para calcular resultados o caracterizar cierta clase. Tienen una fuente, un contexto geográfico, un año, una descripción y un valor"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Parámetro"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid521"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid522"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid523"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid524"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ParameterNature",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "La naturaleza de los valores de un parámetro, es decir, si es una constante, si se calcula o si caracteriza de algún modo la incertidumbre. Debe usarse para definir parámetros junto con «Parameter» o cualquiera de sus subclases; p. ej., un individuo que define el coste de un fármaco debería pertenecer tanto a «Cost» como a «DeterministicParameter»"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The nature of the values of a parameter, i.e., whether it is a constant, calculated, or characterizes uncertainty somehow. This must be used to define parameters together with 'Parameter' or any of its subclasses, i.e. an individual defining the cost of a drug should be subclass of both 'Cost' and 'DeterministicParameter'"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Naturaleza del parámetro"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Parameter nature"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointUnionOf" : [ {
    "@list" : [ {
      "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#CalculatedParameter"
    }, {
      "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DeterministicParameter"
    }, {
      "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#FirstOrderUncertaintyParameter"
    }, {
      "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#SecondOrderUncertaintyParameter"
    } ]
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid525"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Pathway",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "La forma en que aparece una enfermedad, desarrollo, manifestación o estadio, es decir, las condiciones que deben cumplirse para llegar a cualquiera de ellos."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The way a disease, development, manifestation or stage appears, i.e., the conditions that must be met to lead to any of these."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Pathway"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Ruta"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid534"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid535"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid536"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid537"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid538"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#PoissonDistributionExpression",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Discrete probability distribution used to model the number of events occurring within a given time interval. It is defined by a real number (lambda)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Distribución de probabilidad discreta usada para modelar el número de eventos que ocurren en un intervalo de tiempo dado. Se define mediante un número real (lambda)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Expresión para distribución de probabilidad de Poisson"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Expression for a Poisson probability distribution"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ProbabilityDistributionExpression"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid542"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid543"
  } ]
}, {
