}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#PositiveDetectionOutcome",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A positive result of a detection strategy: the individual is detected (true positive if diseased, false positive otherwise). It is usually followed by a confirmatory diagnosis. When it is followed by a diagnosis strategy, the diagnosis confirms the result; when it is followed by another detection strategy (e.g., a second-tier test), the individual is tested again. Without its own followedByStrategy, it is followed by the followedByStrategy of its detection strategy, if any."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Un resultado positivo de una estrategia de detección: el individuo es detectado (verdadero positivo si tiene la enfermedad, falso positivo en otro caso). Normalmente va seguido de un diagnóstico de confirmación. Si va seguido de una estrategia de diagnóstico, el diagnóstico confirma el resultado; si va seguido de otra estrategia de detección (p. ej., una prueba de segundo nivel), el individuo vuelve a someterse a una prueba. Sin su propio followedByStrategy, le sigue el followedByStrategy de su estrategia de detección, si lo hay."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Positive detection outcome"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Resultado positivo de una detección"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionOutcome"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ProbabilityDistributionExpression",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An expression that defines a probability distribution"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Una expresión que define una distribución de probabilidad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Expresión para distribución de probabilidad"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Probability distribution expression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid567"
