}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasReplacementStrategy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "La estrategia, o grupo de estrategias, que sustituye a las estrategias de la condición de salud afectada por un efecto de sustitución de estrategia."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The strategy, or group of strategies, that replaces the strategies of the health condition affected by a strategy replacement effect."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#StrategyReplacementEffect"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has replacement strategy"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la estrategia de sustitución"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid66"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasRiskCharacterization",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define la caracterización del riesgo de un elemento de progresión clínica, que puede expresarse como un parámetro (p. ej., un riesgo relativo) o como una vía (p. ej., una vía que define los eventos que llevan a la aparición de cierta manifestación). Un desarrollo o una manifestación crónica sin caracterización del riesgo que no pertenece a un grupo de dos o más progresiones alternativas (es decir, no afectado por ninguna regla de combinación, afectado por una regla de coexistencia, o por una regla de alternativas con un solo miembro) está siempre activo en su contexto: se aplica desde el inicio, y una manifestación sin riesgo que depende de un desarrollo (hasSubProgression) está activa siempre que ese desarrollo lo esté. Dentro de un grupo de dos o más progresiones alternativas, la progresión sin riesgo (como mucho una, y solo si el grupo no tiene progresión nula) se lleva la probabilidad restante (1 menos la suma del resto). Tanto los árboles de decisión como las simulaciones de eventos discretos deberían interpretar así las progresiones sin riesgo. Para un efecto adverso, el riesgo es obligatorio y es una probabilidad por aplicación de la estrategia que lo provoca (o un tiempo hasta el evento en una simulación)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the risk characterization of a clinical progression element, which can be expressed as a parameter (e.g., relative risk) or as a pathway (e.g., a pathway that defines the events that lead to the occurrence of a certain manifestation). A development or chronic manifestation without risk characterization that does not belong to a group of two or more alternative progressions (i.e., not affected by any combination rule, affected by a coexistent rule, or by an alternative rule with a single member) is always active in its context: it applies from the start, and a manifestation without risk that depends on a development (hasSubProgression) is active whenever such development is active. Within a group of two or more alternative progressions, the progression without risk (at most one, and only if the group has no null progression) takes the remaining probability (1 minus the sum of the rest). Both decision trees and discrete-event simulations should interpret progressions without risk in this way. For an adverse event, the risk is mandatory and is a probability per application of the strategy that causes it (or a time to event in a simulation)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid73"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has risk characterization"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la caracterización de riesgo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid76"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isRiskCharacterizationOf"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#TODO" : [ {
    "@value" : "Check if this is the best name for the property"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasRiskIfDiseased",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "How likely an outcome of a detection strategy is for an individual that has the detected disease (e.g., the sensitivity, for a positive result without inconclusive results). The outcome without this risk takes the remaining probability."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Lo probable que es un resultado de una estrategia de detección para un individuo que tiene la enfermedad detectada (p. ej., la sensibilidad, para un resultado positivo sin resultados no concluyentes). El resultado sin este riesgo se lleva la probabilidad restante."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionOutcome"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has risk if diseased"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el riesgo si está enfermo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasOutcomeRisk"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasRiskIfNotDiseased",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "How likely an outcome of a detection strategy is for an individual that does not have the detected disease (e.g., 1 minus the specificity, for a positive result without inconclusive results). The outcome without this risk takes the remaining probability."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Lo probable que es un resultado de una estrategia de detección para un individuo que no tiene la enfermedad detectada (p. ej., 1 menos la especificidad, para un resultado positivo sin resultados no concluyentes). El resultado sin este riesgo se lleva la probabilidad restante."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionOutcome"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has risk if not diseased"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el riesgo si no está enfermo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasOutcomeRisk"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasScaleParameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define un factor que multiplica el valor de la variable aleatoria definida por la distribución (antes de sumar el desplazamiento, ver hasOffsetParameter). No es el parámetro de escala de una distribución gamma, que es hasThetaParameter."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a factor that multiplies the value of the random variable defined by the distribution (before adding the offset, see hasOffsetParameter). It is not the scale parameter of a gamma distribution, which is hasThetaParameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ProbabilityDistributionExpression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has scale parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el parámetro de escala"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasProbabilityDistributionParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSensitivity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "En epidemiología, la sensibilidad es la probabilidad de clasificar correctamente a un individuo enfermo, es decir, la probabilidad de obtener un resultado positivo en una prueba diagnóstica para un sujeto enfermo. La sensibilidad es, por tanto, la capacidad de la prueba complementaria para detectar la enfermedad. La sensibilidad es el porcentaje de verdaderos positivos o la probabilidad de que la prueba sea positiva si la enfermedad está presente; los falsos negativos son sujetos enfermos diagnosticados como sanos. En una estrategia de detección, hasSensitivity y hasSpecificity son la forma abreviada de dos resultados: un PositiveDetectionOutcome (seguido del followedByStrategy de la estrategia, si lo hay) y un NegativeDetectionOutcome. No pueden combinarse con hasStrategyOutcome."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The Sensitivity in epidemiology is the Probability of correctly classifying a sick individual, that is, the Probability that a positive result will be obtained in a diagnostic test for a sick subject. The Sensitivity is, therefore, the ability of the complementary test to detect the disease. Sensitivity is the percentage of true positives or the Probability that the test is positive if the disease is present; False negatives are sick subjects diagnosed as healthy. In a detection strategy, hasSensitivity and hasSpecificity are the short form of two outcomes: a PositiveDetectionOutcome (followed by the followedByStrategy of the strategy, if any) and a NegativeDetectionOutcome. They cannot be combined with hasStrategyOutcome."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionStrategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has sensitivity"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la sensibilidad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSex",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el sexo de la población, que puede usarse para definir las características de la enfermedad y de las intervenciones. El valor es la proporción de mujeres en la población."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the sex of the population, which can be used to define the characteristics of the disease and the interventions. The value is the proportion of female individuals in the population."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has sex"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene sexo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid79"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesAttributeValue"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSize",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Number of individuals in the population"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Número de individuos de la población"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has size"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el tamaño"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSource",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Fuente del valor del parámetro, p. ej., una referencia bibliográfica, el nombre de un conjunto de datos, el nombre de una persona experta..."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Source of the parameter value, e.g., a bibliographic reference, name of a dataset, name of an expert..."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has source"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la fuente"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSpecificity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "La especificidad de una prueba es la probabilidad de que un sujeto sano tenga un resultado negativo. La especificidad es el porcentaje de verdaderos negativos o la probabilidad de que la prueba sea negativa si la enfermedad no está presente. Los falsos positivos son sujetos sanos diagnosticados como enfermos. En una estrategia de detección, hasSensitivity y hasSpecificity son la forma abreviada de dos resultados (ver hasSensitivity)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The Specificity of a test is the Probability that a healthy subject will have a negative test result. Specificity is the percentage of true negatives or the Probability that the test will be negative if the disease is not present. False positives are healthy subjects diagnosed as sick. In a detection strategy, hasSensitivity and hasSpecificity are the short form of two outcomes (see hasSensitivity)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionStrategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has specificity"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la especificidad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasStandardDeviationParameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el parámetro de la desviación estándar de una distribución de probabilidad"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the standard deviation parameter of a probability distribution"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ProbabilityDistributionExpression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has standard deviation parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el parámetro de desviación estándar"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasProbabilityDistributionParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasStartOffset",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tiempo transcurrido entre un punto de referencia y el inicio de la pauta. El punto de referencia es el final de la pauta anterior si existe (hasPrevious), o el inicio de la pauta, estrategia o tecnología sanitaria padre en otro caso. La unidad por defecto es años."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Time elapsed between a reference point and the start of the guideline. The reference point is the end of the previous guideline if it has one (hasPrevious), or the start of the parent guideline, strategy or health technology otherwise. Default unit is years."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has start offset"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el desfase de inicio"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasStrategy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una condición de salud o estrategia y una estrategia, que puede ser una estrategia simple o un grupo de estrategias. Esta propiedad permite definir las estrategias que se aplican a una condición de salud o estrategia, así como las estrategias que forman parte de un grupo de estrategias. Las intervenciones no declaran estrategias directamente: sustituyen las estrategias de una condición de salud mediante un StrategyReplacementEffect."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a health condition or strategy and a strategy, which can be either a simple strategy or a group of strategies. This property allows us to define the strategies that are applied to a health condition or strategy, as well as the strategies that are part of a group of strategies. Interventions do not declare strategies directly: they replace the strategies of a health condition through a StrategyReplacementEffect."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid80"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has strategy"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la estrategia"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid83"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isStrategyOf"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasStrategyOutcome",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define los resultados mutuamente excluyentes de una estrategia (ver StrategyOutcome). No puede combinarse con las formas abreviadas failsIf (para cualquier estrategia) o hasSensitivity y hasSpecificity (para una estrategia de detección)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the mutually exclusive outcomes of a strategy (see StrategyOutcome). It cannot be combined with the short forms failsIf (for any strategy) or hasSensitivity and hasSpecificity (for a detection strategy)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has strategy outcome"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el resultado de la estrategia"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#StrategyOutcome"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isStrategyOutcomeOf"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSubGuideline",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Relaciona una pauta con cada una de sus subpautas directas. Una pauta puede descomponerse recursivamente; la forma de combinar las subpautas se indica con hasSubGuidelineCombination. No es transitiva a propósito: usa la ruta SPARQL hasSubGuideline+ para obtener todos los descendientes."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates a guideline to each of its direct sub-guidelines. A guideline may be decomposed recursively; the way sub-guidelines are combined is stated with hasSubGuidelineCombination. Intentionally not transitive: use the SPARQL path hasSubGuideline+ to retrieve all descendants."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has sub-guideline"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene subpauta"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSubGuidelineOf"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSubGuidelineCombination",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Indica cómo se combinan las subpautas directas de una pauta compuesta: simultáneas, secuenciales (ordenadas con hasNext/hasPrevious) o alternativas excluyentes (seleccionadas por sus condiciones de aplicación)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "States how the direct sub-guidelines of a composite guideline are combined: concurrently, sequentially (ordered with hasNext/hasPrevious) or as mutually exclusive alternatives (selected by their applicability conditions)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#CompositeGuideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has sub-guideline combination"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene combinación de subpautas"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombinationMode"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSubProgression",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un elemento de progresión clínica y su subelemento, indicando que el subelemento solo aparece como parte de la progresión clínica."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a clinical progression element and its sub-element, indicating that the sub-element only appear as a part of the clinical progression."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has sub-progression"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "has sub-progression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasSubpopulation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una población y una subpoblación, indicando que la subpoblación es un subconjunto de la población."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a population and a subpopulation, indicating that the subpopulation is a subset of the population."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has subpopulation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la subpoblación"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSubPopulationOf"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasTemporaryThreshold",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Plazo en el que debe tomarse la muestra. Por ejemplo, el tercer día tras el nacimiento. Este valor debe expresarse en días."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Time limit in which the sample must be made. For example on the third day of birth. This value must be expressed in number of days."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ScreeningStrategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has temporary threshold"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el umbral temporal"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasThetaParameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el parámetro de escala (theta) de una distribución gamma, cuya media es k * theta, con k su forma (hasAlfaParameter). Para una distribución gamma expresada con una tasa lambda, theta = 1 / lambda."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the scale parameter (theta) of a gamma distribution, whose mean is k * theta, with k its shape (hasAlfaParameter). For a gamma distribution expressed with a rate lambda, theta = 1 / lambda."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GammaDistributionExpression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has theta parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el parámetro theta"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasProbabilityDistributionParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasTimeHorizon",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el horizonte temporal (en años) que se aplica a una simulación. En un árbol de decisión, limita los años de vida de cada hoja y los pagos que dependen de ellos; sin él, el horizonte es la vida entera."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the time horizon (in years) applied to a simulation. In a decision tree, it limits the life years of each leaf, and the payoffs that depend on them; without it, the horizon is the lifetime."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Experiment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has time horizon"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene horizonte temporal"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasUncertaintyCharacterization",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define la caracterización de la incertidumbre de un parámetro, que puede expresarse como otro parámetro (p. ej., un intervalo de confianza) o como una expresión de distribución de probabilidad."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the uncertainty characterization of a parameter, which can be expressed as another parameter (e.g., confidence interval) or as a probability distribution expression."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid90"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has uncertainty characterization"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la caracterización de incertidumbre"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid93"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isUncertaintyCharacterizationOf"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasUnit",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Unidad de medida de un tipo de elemento de datos, p. ej., «años», «kg», «número de casos»..."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Unit of measurement of a data item type, e.g., \"years\", \"kg\", \"number of cases\"..."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#MeasuredDataItemType"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has unit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la unidad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasUpperLimitParameter",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el parámetro del límite superior de una distribución uniforme"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the upper limit parameter of a uniform distribution"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#UniformDistributionExpression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has upper limit parameter"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el parámetro de límite superior"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasProbabilityDistributionParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasUtility",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define la utilidad asociada a una condición de salud, intervención, ruta, población o elemento de uso de recursos. La utilidad es una medida de la preferencia o del valor que los individuos o la sociedad asignan a un estado de salud o resultado concreto. Se usa a menudo en economía de la salud y en análisis de decisiones para evaluar lo deseables que son distintos resultados en salud y para informar la toma de decisiones sanitarias."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the utility associated with a health condition, intervention, pathway, population or resource usage item. The utility is a measure of the preference or value that individuals or society assign to a particular health state or outcome. It is often used in health economics and decision analysis to evaluate the desirability of different health outcomes and to inform healthcare decision-making."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid96"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has utility"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene la utilidad"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Utility"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#hasYear",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Año en que se recogen los datos de coste"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Year in which the cost data is collected"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid198"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "has year"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "tiene el año"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#short"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#includedByModel",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un elemento del modelo y un modelo, indicando que el elemento forma parte de la estructura o del contenido del modelo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a model item and a model, indicating that the model item is included as part of the structure or content of the model."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "included by model"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "incluido por el modelo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#includesModelItem"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#includesModelItem",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un modelo y un elemento del modelo, indicando que el modelo incluye ese elemento como parte de su estructura o contenido."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a model and a model item, indicating that the model includes that item as part of its structure or content."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "includes model item"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "incluye el elemento del modelo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ModelItem"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isAdverseEventOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Inversa de hasAdverseEvent."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Inverse of hasAdverseEvent."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AdverseEvent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es efecto adverso de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is adverse event of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isAffectedBy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un atributo, parámetro o condición de salud y un efecto, indicando que se ve afectado por ese efecto. Una condición de salud solo puede verse afectada por un StrategyReplacementEffect."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between an attribute, parameter or health condition and an effect, indicating that it is affected by that effect. A health condition can only be affected by a StrategyReplacementEffect."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid104"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es modificado por"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is modified by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Effect"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isAssessedInterventionOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Relaciona una intervención con un modelo en el que se evalúa su valor (inversa de hasAssessedIntervention)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates an intervention to a model in which its value is assessed (inverse of hasAssessedIntervention)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Intervention"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es la intervención evaluada de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is assessed intervention of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#includedByModel"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isComparatorInterventionOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Relaciona una intervención con un modelo en el que se usa como comparador (inversa de hasComparatorIntervention)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates an intervention to a model in which it is used as comparator (inverse of hasComparatorIntervention)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Intervention"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es la intervención como comparador de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is comparator intervention of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#includedByModel"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isConditionExpressionOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una expresión de condición y una pauta o estrategia, indicando que la expresión de condición se usa dentro de la pauta o estrategia."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a condition expression and a guideline or strategy, indicating that the condition expression is used within the guideline or strategy."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es expresión de condición de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is condition expression of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid108"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isDataItemTypeOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un tipo de elemento de datos y un parámetro, indicando que el tipo de elemento de datos se usa para definir el parámetro."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a data item type and a parameter, indicating that the data item type is used to define the parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DataItemType"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es tipo de elemento de datos de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is data item type of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isDetectedBy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una enfermedad y una estrategia de detección, indicando que esa estrategia se usa para identificar la enfermedad."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a disease and a detection strategy, indicating that such strategy is used to identify the disease."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Disease"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es detectado por"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is detected by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DetectionStrategy"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isDisutility",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Indica si un parámetro de utilidad representa una desutilidad o una utilidad. Una utilidad u (isDisutility = false) de una progresión, la enfermedad o una intervención equivale a una desutilidad de (utilidad basal de la población - u), de modo que el paciente obtiene exactamente u si es la única activa. El valor convertido se combina con el resto de desutilidades mediante el método de combinación de desutilidades del experimento (hasDisutilityCombinationMethod). Esto se aplica tanto a las utilidades anuales como a las de una vez, y supone que la utilidad se midió en una población con la misma utilidad basal que la del modelo. Una desutilidad de una vez es una pérdida de AVAC por episodio, que se suma cuando se aplica una estrategia o un resultado de una estrategia, o cuando aparece una manifestación."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Indicates whether a utility parameter represents a disutility or a utility. A utility u (isDisutility = false) of a progression, the disease or an intervention is equivalent to a disutility of (base utility of the population - u), so the patient gets exactly u if it is the only one active. The converted value is combined with the rest of disutilities by using the disutility combination method of the experiment (hasDisutilityCombinationMethod). This applies both to annual and one-time utilities, and assumes that the utility was measured in a population with the same base utility as that of the model. A one-time disutility is a loss of QALYs per episode, added when a strategy or an outcome of a strategy is applied, or when a manifestation appears."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Utility"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es una desutilidad"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is disutility"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isEffectOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un efecto y una condición de salud, intervención, ruta, población o elemento de uso de recursos, indicando que el efecto está asociado a ese elemento."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between an effect and a health condition, intervention, pathway, population or resource usage item, indicating that the effect is associated with that element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Effect"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es efecto de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is effect of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid111"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isExpressionLanguageOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un lenguaje de expresión y un parámetro calculado, indicando que el lenguaje de expresión se usa para definir el parámetro calculado."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between an expression language and a calculated parameter, indicating that the expression language is used to define the calculated parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ExpressionLanguage"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es lenguaje de expresión de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is expression language of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#CalculatedParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isGroupItemOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Indica que un elemento del modelo pertenece a un grupo (inversa de hasGroupItem)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Indicates that a model item belongs to a group (inverse of hasGroupItem)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GroupableModelItem"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "belongs to group"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "pertenece al grupo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Group"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002350"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isGuidelineOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una pauta y una tecnología sanitaria o estrategia, indicando que la pauta está asociada a esa tecnología o estrategia."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a guideline and a health technology or strategy, indicating that the guideline is associated with that technology or strategy."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es guía o pauta de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is guideline of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid117"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isInterventionOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define el objetivo de una intervención, es decir, la condición de salud (la enfermedad o un elemento de su progresión) a la que se aplica. Inversa de hasIntervention, que describe su semántica. Cada intervención tiene exactamente un objetivo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the target of an intervention, i.e., the health condition (the disease or an element of its progression) to which it is applied. Inverse of hasIntervention, which describes its semantics. Every intervention has exactly one target."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Intervention"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es intervención de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is intervention of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#HealthCondition"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isOccurrenceOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Identifica la condición de salud de la que el efecto adverso es una aparición (p. ej., el efecto adverso «diarrea por amoxicilina» es una aparición de «diarrea»). Solo la identifica: el efecto adverso no activa la progresión, los pagos ni los efectos de esa condición."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Identifies the health condition of which the adverse event is an occurrence (e.g., the adverse event 'diarrhoea due to amoxicillin' is an occurrence of 'diarrhoea'). It only identifies the condition: the adverse event does not activate the progression, payoffs or effects of that condition."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AdverseEvent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es una aparición de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is occurrence of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#HealthCondition"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isParameterOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un parámetro y un elemento de progresión clínica, enfermedad, intervención, ruta, población o elemento de uso de recursos, indicando que el parámetro está asociado a ese elemento."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a parameter and a clinical progression element, disease, intervention, pathway, population or resource usage item, indicating that the parameter is associated with that element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es parámetro de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is parameter of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid120"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isProgressionElementOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un elemento de progresión de la enfermedad y una enfermedad o regla de combinación de progresiones."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a disease progression element and a disease or progression combination rule."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#DiseaseProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es elemento de progresión de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is progression element of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid128"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isRequiredBy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un elemento de progresión clínica y una ruta, indicando que la ruta requiere el elemento."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a clinical progression element and a pathway, indicating that the element is required by the pathway."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid131"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es requerido por"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is required by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Pathway"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#requires"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isRiskCharacterizationOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una caracterización del riesgo y un elemento de progresión clínica o un efecto adverso, indicando que la caracterización se aplica a ese elemento."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a risk characterization and a clinical progression element or an adverse event, indicating that the characterization applies to that element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid134"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es caracterización de riesgo de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is risk characterization of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid137"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isStrategyOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Relaciona una estrategia con la condición de salud o la estrategia que la declara, o con el grupo de estrategias al que pertenece (inversa de hasStrategy)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates a strategy to the health condition or strategy that declares it, or to the group of strategies it belongs to (inverse of hasStrategy)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es estrategia de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is strategy of"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isStrategyOutcomeOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Inversa de hasStrategyOutcome."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Inverse of hasStrategyOutcome."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#StrategyOutcome"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es resultado de la estrategia"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is strategy outcome of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSubGuidelineOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Relaciona una subpauta con su pauta padre. Inversa de hasSubGuideline."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates a sub-guideline to its parent guideline. Inverse of hasSubGuideline."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es subpauta de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is sub-guideline of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Guideline"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSubPopulationOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre dos poblaciones, indicando que la población del dominio es una subpoblación de la población del rango."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between two populations, indicating that the domain population is a subpopulation of the range population."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es subpoblación de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is subpopulation of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Population"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSubProgressionOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre dos elementos de progresión clínica, indicando que el elemento del dominio es un subelemento del elemento del rango."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between two clinical progression elements, indicating that the domain element is a subelement of the range element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es subelemento de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is subelement of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isSupersededByClinicalProgression",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre dos elementos de progresión clínica, indicando que el elemento del rango reemplaza al elemento del dominio."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between two clinical progression elements, indicating that the domain element is superseded by the range element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es reemplazado por"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is superseded by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#supersedesClinicalProgression"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isTrueEpidemiologicalParameterEstimate",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Indica si un parámetro epidemiológico es una estimación verdadera del parámetro o una estimación con sesgos conocidos"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Indicates whether an epidemiological parameter is a true estimate of the parameter or an estimation with known biases"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#EpidemiologicalParameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es una estimación verdadera de un parámetro epidemiológico"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is true epidemiological parameter estimate"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isUncertaintyCharacterizationOf",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una caracterización de la incertidumbre y un parámetro o una expresión de distribución de probabilidad, indicando que la caracterización se aplica a ese elemento."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between an uncertainty characterization and a parameter or probability distribution expression, indicating that the characterization applies to that element."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid140"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es caracterización de incertidumbre de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is uncertainty characterization of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid143"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isUsedAsAttributeValueBy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un parámetro de valor de atributo y una enfermedad o población, indicando que el parámetro se usa como valor de atributo para esa enfermedad o población."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between an attribute value parameter and a disease or population, indicating that the parameter is used as an attribute value for that disease or population."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AttributeValueParameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es utilizado como valor de atributo por"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is used as attribute value by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid146"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesAttributeValue"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isUsedByStrategy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una tecnología sanitaria y una estrategia, indicando que la tecnología sanitaria se usa en esa estrategia."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a health technology and a strategy, indicating that the health technology is used in that strategy."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#HealthTechnology"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es utilizado por la estrategia"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is used by strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesHealthTechnology"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#isValueOfAttribute",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre un parámetro y un atributo, indicando que el parámetro es un valor de ese atributo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a parameter and an attribute, indicating that the parameter is a value of that attribute."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "es valor del atributo"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "is value of attribute"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Attribute"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#requires",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define que una ruta requiere cierto elemento de progresión clínica o intervención. Puede servir, por ejemplo, para definir que cierta ruta requiere la presencia de cierto síntoma o solo aparece cuando se aplica cierta intervención."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines that a pathway requires a certain clinical progression element or intervention. This can be useful for defining that a certain pathway requires the presence of a certain symptom or only appears when a certain intervention is applied."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Pathway"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "requiere"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "requires"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid149"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#resolvesHealthCondition",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Si un resultado de una estrategia resuelve la condición de salud en cuyo contexto se aplica la estrategia (falso si no se define). Para una manifestación aguda, termina el episodio. Para una condición de salud crónica, es una curación: sus pagos anuales y sus efectos se detienen cuando ocurre el resultado (ver hasEvaluationTime)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Whether an outcome of a strategy resolves the health condition in whose context the strategy is applied (false if not defined). For an acute manifestation, it ends the episode. For a chronic health condition, it is a cure: its annual payoffs and effects stop when the outcome happens (see hasEvaluationTime)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#TreatmentOutcome"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "resolves health condition"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "resuelve la condición de salud"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#resolvesOnSuccess",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma abreviada (ver failsIf): si el éxito de una estrategia resuelve la condición de salud (ver resolvesHealthCondition)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Short form (see failsIf): whether the success of a strategy resolves the health condition (see resolvesHealthCondition)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "resolves on success"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "resuelve en caso de éxito"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#supersedesClinicalProgression",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define que un elemento de progresión clínica reemplaza a otro. Puede servir, por ejemplo, para definir que cierta manifestación reemplaza a otra en la progresión de la enfermedad, como cuando un síntoma aparece tras desaparecer otro."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines that a clinical progression element replaces another one. This can be useful for defining that a certain manifestation replaces another one in the progression of the disease, for example, to define that a certain symptom appears after the disappearance of another symptom."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "reemplaza la progresión clínica"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "supersedes clinical progression"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#ClinicalProgressionElement"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesAttributeValue",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una enfermedad o población y un parámetro que es el valor de un atributo"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a disease or population and a parameter which is the value of an attribute"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid152"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "usa el valor del atributo"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "uses attribute value"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#AttributeValueParameter"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesHealthTechnology",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define una relación entre una estrategia y una tecnología sanitaria usada en ella. Es útil para definir las tecnologías sanitarias usadas en una estrategia; por ejemplo, que cierto fármaco se usa en una estrategia de tratamiento o que cierta prueba de cribado se usa en una estrategia de cribado."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines a relationship between a strategy and a health technology used in that strategy. This is useful for defining the health technologies used in a strategy, for example, to define that a certain drug is used in a treatment strategy or that a certain screening test is used in a screening strategy."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Strategy"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "uses health technology"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "utiliza tecnología sanitaria"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#HealthTechnology"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesModel",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An experiment uses certain model"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Un experimento usa cierto modelo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Experiment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "usa el modelo"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "uses model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#usesSameModelItemsAs",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Define que un modelo usa los mismos elementos de datos que otro modelo. Útil para no «recrear» esa relación para todos los elementos del modelo en modelos muy parecidos que solo difieren en algunas características."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines that a model uses the same data items as another model. Useful for avoiding \"recreating\" that relationship for all the model items in models which are very similar and simply differ in some characteristics."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "uses same model items as"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "utiliza los mismos elementos del modelo que"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Model"
  } ]
} ]